{
  "$Comment": "Harvest Salad, the second of Martha's three dishes: carrots, corn and pumpkin from the fields, made at a Chef's Stove (the Cookingbench, its Prepared tab) once a player has learned it from Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Harvest_Salad, sold at her shop. It wears the game's Caesar salad bowl (its model, texture and icon) and eats like the game's best salads: an instant heal, Harvest_Feast_Food_Regen (the game's top food regen, for ten minutes) and Harvest_Feast_Food_Stamina, which beats the game's best fruit and vegetable buff. It clears the game's own food regens and fruit and vegetable buffs first, so they never stack from this side. Its description in items.lang writes the numbers out: change it with the effects. Recipe.Input is what it costs to make. The dish is good all year; only the recipe is feast-only.",
